    <briefdescription>
<para>CRTP mixin that adds typed attribute storage to a node class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enables method chaining via a <computeroutput>Derived*</computeroutput> return type, e.g.: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Node<sp/>*n<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespaceONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1a4fff85175c0c40095ead43cb1a415682ab2f5ff47436671b6e533d8dc3614845d" kindref="member">g</ref>-&gt;create(kSelect)-&gt;i_(kOffset,<sp/>3)-&gt;f_(kValue,<sp/>3.5f);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Attribute lookup is O(n) in the number of attributes to keep deterministic ordering; nodes are not expected to carry a large number of attributes.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Derived</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The concrete node type that inherits this mixin. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
